==The Shrimp and Parrot==
[[File:The Shrimp and Parrot.png|right|250x250px]]
This is the original version of [[The Shrimp and Parrot]] that can be found in [[Brimhaven]]. Upon the release of [[Tai Bwo Wannai Trio]], the shop was updated to sell [[Cooked Karambwan]]. Rather than update the shop, a new version was created that took its place; the original shop has remained unused and inaccessible ever since.
